      "summary": "## Ours\n\nThe **3f+1 patty bound**: the formula survives while at most `f` of the `3f+1` cooks is a spy.\n\n- §5 — the main proof\n- §6 — the *karate chop lemma* (Sandy)\n- §7 — evaluation over one Friday dinner rush\n\n> Reviewer 2 wants a larger grill.",
      "thought": "Our secret formula holds even when one cook is a spy.",
      "is_author": true,
      "rating_expertise": 5,
      "rating_reading": 5,
      "rating_liking": 5,
      "tag_uuids": [
        "00000000-0000-4000-8000-b00000000003",
